On Thu, 12 Mar 2026 20:59:00 +0000, Samuel Becker <sbecker@cloudfin-systems.com> wrote:
> Hi Ahmed Al-Mansoor,
> 
> Root Cause Analysis and Resolution:
> Discovered that the database connection pool on the OAuth2 consent verification microservice was exhausted due to missing keep-alive timeouts on idle connections. Implemented connection reaping after 15s and increased ingress proxy timeout from 30s to 60s. Refreshed sandbox key store certificates.
> 
> Both your primary operational inquiry and the secondary item have been addressed and verified in our production monitoring dashboards. All transaction queues have returned to normal baseline latency.
> 
> Please confirm if everything is functioning as expected on your end so we can close out ticket BNK-2026087.
